  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons without an installed Capacity modifying attachment</p>\n<p><em>“Remember – switching to your pistol is always faster than reloading. Or just get a bigger magazine, doomba.”</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV21 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Flared Magwell may be installed. The weapon gains 1 Attachment Slot that can only accept Capacity modifying Attachments. This can be used in tandem with other open Attachment Slots for Capacity-modifying Attachments that consume 2 or more Attachment Slots (i.e., a Weapon with 1 open slot and a Flared Magwell can install a Belt Box, which normally requires 2 open slots).</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Capacity &amp; Reloading).</em></p>"
